  "privacyTitle": "Privacy summary",
  "@privacyTitle": {
    "description": "Privacy summary screen title."
  },
  "privacyBody": "• We collect your email, the name you choose and, only while sharing is on, your location.\n• Your location, alerts and places are end-to-end encrypted. Only the members you share with can read them, not AfriSafety.\n• We never sell or share your data with advertisers or data brokers.\n• You can pause, leave a Circle, or sign out at any time. Signing out removes this phone's keys.\n• Data is stored with our hosting provider (Supabase), which may be outside South Africa. See the full policy for details.\n• Questions or requests under POPIA: contact the AfriSafety Information Officer listed in the full policy.",
  "@privacyBody": {
    "description": "Plain-language privacy summary."
  },
